"GUN|56-1type|MOOD2", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "770612": {"id": 770612, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|56-1type|FORMATION", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"770601": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "770602": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "770603": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "770604": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "WIN", "caption": "Of COURSE we won! I'm strong, after all."}, "770605": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "Just give me meat-filled rice dumplings for my field rations. They're fantastic even if they're cold!"}, "770606": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "BLACKACTION", "caption": "Drown in the ocean of the People's struggle!"}, "770607": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "LOADING", "caption": "Aw, let's eat our fill first before going~"}, "770608": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "I'm not just a glutton, I take training seriously too. Besides, snacks taste even better after training, hehe."}, "770609": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Commander, as the saying goes, \"you can't fight on an empty stomach\". Come, I grabbed us an extra lunch box. Let's eat it during our break."}, "770610": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "Commander, what are your instructions?<>Huh? You're serious? Did you fall in love with my culinary skills?<>In any case, it's too late for regret now, ahaha! I'm not going to let you go!"}, "770611": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "MOOD2", "caption": ""}, "770612": {"char_code": "56-1type", "voice_key": "FORMATION", "caption": "A mission? I'll do my best!"}}}